      <div type="layout" source="#source-69360-69732" style="padding-inline-start: 1em">
        <p source="#source-69395-69409"><seg source="#source-69395-69409">時は春、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-69409-69438"><seg source="#source-69409-69415">日は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69415-69433"><rb>朝</rb><rt>あした</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-69433-69438">、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-69438-69470"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69438-69456"><rb>朝</rb><rt>あした</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-69456-69470">は七時、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-69470-69514"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69470-69494"><rb>片岡</rb><rt>かたをか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-69494-69514">に露みちて、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-69514-69564"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69514-69544"><rb>揚雲雀</rb><rt>あげひばり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-69544-69564">なのりいで、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-69564-69629"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69564-69591"><rb>蝸牛</rb><rt>かたつむり</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69591-69606"><rb>枝</rb><rt>えだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-69606-69609">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69609-69621"><rb>這</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-69621-69629">ひ、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-69629-69664"><seg source="#source-69629-69664">神、そらに知ろしめす。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-69664-69696"><seg source="#source-69664-69696">すべて世は事も無し。</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-69734-69759"><pb source="#source-69734-69755"/></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-69759-69888" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
        <div>
          <head n="2" source="#source-69780-69888"><seg source="#source-69801-69858">至上善　　　　　ロバアト・ブラウニング</seg></head>
