        <p source="#source-93604-93717"><seg source="#source-93604-93619">夕暮がたの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93619-93634"><rb>蕭</rb><rt>しめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93634-93646">やかさ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93646-93667"><rb>燈火</rb><rt>あかり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93667-93673">無き</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93673-93685"><rb>室</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93685-93688">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93688-93703"><rb>蕭</rb><rt>しめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93703-93717">やかさ。</seg></p>
