        <p source="#source-93874-93956"><seg source="#source-93874-93889">まづ天井の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93889-93916"><rb>薄明</rb><rt>うすあかり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93916-93956">、光は消えて日も暮れぬ。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-93956-94036"><seg source="#source-93956-93986">物静かなる死の如く、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93986-94010"><rb>微笑</rb><rt>ほほゑみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94010-94036">作るかはたれに、</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-94036-94125"><seg source="#source-94036-94066">曇れる鏡よく見れば、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94066-94084"><rb>別</rb><rt>わかれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94084-94087">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94087-94108"><rb>手振</rb><rt>てぶり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94108-94125">うれたくも</seg></p>
