        <p source="#source-94782-94945"><seg source="#source-94782-94791">沈める</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94791-94806"><rb>音</rb><rt>おと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94806-94809">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94809-94824"><rb>絃</rb><rt>いと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94824-94827">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94827-94839"><rb>器</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94839-94845">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94845-94916"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-3-1-85-66" source="#source-94845-94904">桛</g></rb><rt>かせ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94916-94945">をかけたる思にて、</seg></p>
