        <p source="#source-95209-95316"><seg source="#source-95209-95215">いと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-95215-95233"><rb>徐</rb><rt>おもむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-95233-95245">ろに日の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-95245-95272"><rb>光陰</rb><rt>ひかりかぐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-95272-95287">ろひてゆく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-95287-95302"><rb>蕭</rb><rt>しめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-95302-95316">やかさ。</seg></p>
